 //! Settings-only scroll physics, composed from ordinary clipped rectangles.
+//!
+//! Motion is an exponential ease toward a target that is always inside the
+//! content. It never overshoots, so the first and last rows stay fully
+//! reachable and nothing bounces at an edge.
